    "Expired workflow history and stale projections are logically excluded, not automatically physically purged; old unproven profile fields are not trusted.",
    "The live answer smoke used isolated BM25, local intent candidates and a synthetic hospital; arbitrary-query remote embedding/reranking and deployed-browser integration were not part of it.",
    "Classifier, character and dense similarity direct acceptance remains disabled without calibration evidence. Dense business retrieval is integrated but external semantic-quality evaluation has not run.",
    "Local composition is deliberately limited to explicit supported grammars, doctor/drug independence and the doctor-slots-v1 template; other relationships use one dynamic decision or clarification.",
    "The final answer stage can paraphrase tool evidence. Citation and output-shape checks do not establish semantic entailment or clinical correctness; real-provider answer quality is unmeasured.",
    "Offline verification did not restart or deploy services; existing real-service integration was not rerun. Browser SSE evidence is recorded separately.",
    "SSE streams progress and provisional model content deltas. Failure retracts the draft; only the terminal result is saved. Persistent Last-Event-ID replay is not implemented.",
    "The business reference bank and 26 synthetic cases are small engineering fixtures. Routing accuracy, semantic gain, live latency and cost savings have not been established."
  ],
